      "review_method": "Assistant source-content and publisher-policy review; not legal clearance or practitioner review.",
      "reviewed_scope": "Two exact plain-text government statement excerpts: portfolio-fed-20230322 and h2b-fdic-joint. The latter was checked against the identical substantive text on the Board co-publication at https://www.federalreserve.gov/newsevents/pressreleases/monetary20230312b.htm because the FDIC URL returned HTTP403. No logo, image, model code or separately attributed third-party expression is included. This review does not extend to Reserve Bank sites or other FDIC excerpts.",
