      "review_method": "Assistant source-content and publisher-policy review; not legal clearance or practitioner review.",
      "reviewed_scope": "Five exact plain-text SEC-created excerpts: exp-vistra-2023-index, systematic-apple-index, systematic-lyft-original-index, systematic-nvidia-index and systematic-sec-time-faq. These contain filing-detail metadata, factual document-list rows or SEC staff FAQ prose, with no linked issuer narrative, contract or image bytes. The FAQ policy evidence is https://www.sec.gov/files/about/webmaster-faq.htm. This review does not approve issuer-authored filings or exhibits merely because SEC hosts them.",
